## **In previous version we lunched our website on [ArtRate.world](http://artrate.world/)**
## 
we were trying to going ahead for our next versions, V2.0 it's going to have  features which are mentioned in thread.

we asked for 5K to cover our UI/UX design! In the event our databases are designed and it almost done in backend section, frontend ended too.

we call this part of platform as V2.0;
in this version we are trying to organize our artists and introduce ArtRate to market;

we have about 1k artists all around Iran in different filed who want to share their original artworks in our platforms and also we want to hold an event to creating specific content for ArtRate;

we are going to crawling to our next version (V3.0) by some updates as v2.1 and v2.2;


